('LEMP','LEMP',NULL,NULL,'scarce',1.48,'capitalized,pointer_only','["proper noun"]','Initialism of Linux, Nginx, MySQL, and PHP/Python/Perl: a combination of software for use as a web server.','proper noun','The E stands for engine, since Nginx is pronounced "engine X".',62,'40_80',1,0.4,317),
