('Weyl algebra','Weyl algebra',NULL,NULL,'unattested',NULL,'multiword,capitalized','["noun"]','The ring of differential operators with polynomial coefficients (in one variable), namely expressions of the form f_m(X)∂_Xᵐ+f_m-1(X)∂_Xᵐ⁻¹+⋯+f_1(X)∂_X+f_0(X).','noun','Named after Hermann Weyl, who introduced them to study the Heisenberg uncertainty principle in quantum mechanics.',113,'80_120',0,0.49,379),
